# Density Compare
# Cadmium (Cd) — real density 8.65 g/cm³. equal masses: Cadmium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Cadmium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.7mm color: #ffd98f at (-20mm, 4.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 69.0 g — the water cube is the reference
